    {
      "file": "demo-examples-1-1.m4a",
      "bitrate": "24k",
      "sha256": "4bab263263c1423b241b9b22473c839f8fc83718bb14a789047876fb9334d884",
      "duration": 45.4,
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1001",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "The difficulty of the last puzzle surprised everyone in our small reading club.",
          "start": 0.25,
          "end": 4.78
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1001",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "After the bakery lost its biggest customer, it fell into serious financial difficulties.",
          "start": 4.95,
          "end": 10.53
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1002",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "My aunt purchased three old maps at a market near the harbor last spring.",
          "start": 10.69,
          "end": 14.69
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1002",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "The climber felt along the smooth rock, looking for any purchase for her fingers.",
          "start": 14.87,
          "end": 19.34
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1003",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "At the summer festival, children could shoot arrows at a large straw target.",
          "start": 19.51,
          "end": 23.84
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1003",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "The film crew will shoot the final scene on the bridge at sunrise.",
          "start": 24.02,
          "end": 27.92
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1003",
          "sense": 3,
          "text": "When the door opened, the cat shot past my legs and into the garden.",
          "start": 28.09,
          "end": 32.05
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1004",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "The museum announced on Monday that it will stay open later on Fridays.",
          "start": 32.22,
          "end": 36.45
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1004",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "Dark clouds over the hills announced the storm long before the first drop fell.",
          "start": 36.61,
          "end": 41.04
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1005",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "Our team meets in the park every Saturday unless the weather is terrible.",
          "start": 41.22,
          "end": 45.27
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "demo-examples-1-2.m4a",
      "bitrate": "24k",
      "sha256": "b297a499a595b767094d4b79d149a7398c16634d20f1b1533688b040b253359b",
      "duration": 41.46,
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1006",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "After college, she wanted to be independent of her parents and pay her own rent.",
          "start": 0.25,
          "end": 5.03
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1006",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "Two independent groups checked the results and reached the same conclusion.",
          "start": 5.21,
          "end": 9.32
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1007",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "Could you recommend a quiet café where I can study for a few hours?",
          "start": 9.5,
          "end": 13.54
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1008",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "We ran a short survey to learn how students get to school each morning.",
          "start": 13.7,
          "end": 17.83
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1008",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "The new teacher stood at the door and surveyed the noisy classroom.",
          "start": 18.0,
          "end": 21.65
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1009",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "The majority of the club members voted to move the meetings to Thursday.",
          "start": 21.83,
          "end": 25.78
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1010",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "The boy used a long stick to pull the ball out of the pond.",
          "start": 25.96,
          "end": 29.36
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1010",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "She stuck a small flag into the top of the sand castle.",
          "start": 29.53,
          "end": 32.69
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1010",
          "sense": 3,
          "text": "Wet sand sticks to your feet, so wash them before you come inside.",
          "start": 32.87,
          "end": 36.65
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1011",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "The hotel guest requested an extra blanket because the room felt cold.",
          "start": 36.83,
          "end": 41.34
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "demo-examples-1-3.m4a",
      "bitrate": "24k",
      "sha256": "c1601672c773550e59b176bd70cb85efd2fe9b594f4172f87d45c77e2ffe60ab",
      "duration": 43.67,
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1012",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "He grew up poor but became rich after his small app became popular.",
          "start": 0.25,
          "end": 4.56
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1012",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "The region is rich in fresh water, so farmers rarely worry about dry summers.",
          "start": 4.73,
          "end": 9.61
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1012",
          "sense": 3,
          "text": "This soup is too rich for me; I prefer something lighter at lunch.",
          "start": 9.78,
          "end": 13.63
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1013",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "A cold wind from the north blew the leaves across the empty playground.",
          "start": 13.81,
          "end": 17.82
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1013",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "From the village, a narrow road winds up through the hills to the lake.",
          "start": 17.99,
          "end": 21.78
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1013",
          "sense": 3,
          "text": "Grandpa still winds his old watch every night before he goes to bed.",
          "start": 21.96,
          "end": 25.93
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1014",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "I asked five friends for help with moving, but none of them were free.",
          "start": 26.1,
          "end": 29.98
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1015",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "At the end of the trip, we exchanged addresses and promised to write letters.",
          "start": 30.16,
          "end": 34.45
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1015",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "You can find a currency exchange counter right next to the arrival gate.",
          "start": 34.62,
          "end": 38.84
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1016",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "Our class has a small budget for the school festival, so we must plan carefully.",
          "start": 39.01,
          "end": 43.54
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "file": "demo-examples-1-4.m4a",
      "bitrate": "24k",
      "sha256": "7d949ffc91f15a69fbfbcf87246832b737d6d53e7b985a35c572d44ab5055d6a",
      "duration": 31.41,
      "entries": [
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1017",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "This little town is famous for its spring flowers and its old stone bridge.",
          "start": 0.25,
          "end": 4.54
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1018",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "The nurse took a small amount of blood from my arm for the test.",
          "start": 4.7,
          "end": 8.2
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1018",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "Though she has royal blood, she lives a simple life on a farm.",
          "start": 8.38,
          "end": 11.83
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1019",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "Jeans are not appropriate for the wedding, so please wear something more formal.",
          "start": 12.02,
          "end": 16.26
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1019",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "The city appropriated extra money to repair the old library roof.",
          "start": 16.44,
          "end": 20.58
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1020",
          "sense": 1,
          "text": "The post office is two blocks from here, just past the flower shop.",
          "start": 20.76,
          "end": 24.57
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1020",
          "sense": 2,
          "text": "He carved a small bird from a block of soft wood.",
          "start": 24.75,
          "end": 27.6
        },
        {
          "id": "ngsl-1020",
          "sense": 3,
          "text": "A fallen tree blocked the road, so the bus had to turn back.",
          "start": 27.78,
          "end": 31.29
        }
      ]
    },
